<title>RUSSIA: Russian weekly inflation unchanged at 0.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian weekly inflation unchanged at 0.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian inflation in the week ended December 23 was 0.3 percent, unchanged from the previous week, the State Statistics Committee said.</p>
<p>If current price trends continue, the monthly inflation rate for the whole of December will be 1.2 percent, after 1.9 percent in November, it said.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN CONSUMER PRICES    w/e Dec 23	   w/e Dec 16</p>
<p>    Week-on-week change		+0.3		    +0.3</p>
<p>					   Dec 1-23	     Nov 1-30</p>
<p>    Average daily inflation	  +0.039		  +0.061</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
